    "What is the travel speed (or the distance-to-time conversion) used to compute travel times between locations?",
    "is travel time computed as Euclidean distance divided by that speed?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for the specific speed/conversion value and separately asks for confirmation of the calculation method (Euclidean distance divided by speed), which are two distinct pieces of information."
}

